  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量工作台-资质管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量工作台\"],\"capability_summary\":\"适用于归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的安卓应用，可查询仅当前团队节点或包含下级组织创建的及被共享的资产。关键配合接口：【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"tools.ebp_app.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/app/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1846773030696265\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1846773030696265\",\"title\":\"获取安卓应用列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8bJFld06\">适用场景：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-FNQcGAdh\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cEc81YYS\">资产归属：归属升级版巨量引擎工作台工作台的安卓应用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-I2WWRI0Y\">场景：查询仅当前团队节点或包含下级组织创建的及被共享的资产</li></ul><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1841600678135242%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22VdeIi%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-63w8F6zC\" id=\"h346b9f0-63w8F6zC\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Oq7aLYRe\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/app/list/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1846773030696265\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1jDDdpYM\" id=\"h346b9f0-1jDDdpYM\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-EvhavDLN\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-MwK7NaiZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-MwK7NaiZ\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ikMhkwe8\" id=\"h346b9f0-ikMhkwe8\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yNBBiDNJ\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sx0on9Il\">账户类型，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Mr1jGQBM\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BD3BbNmW\"><code>EBP</code> 升级版巨量引擎工作台</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_management_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">资产范围，可选值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-b9dmdK71\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U4cZHVBG\"><code>DIRECT</code> ：仅查询入参组织创建或被共享的资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T3BOPjBI\"><code>TRAVERSE</code> ：查询入参组织及下属组织创建或被共享的资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VZXjufEF\">过滤条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_key</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jM7jOqZ1\">搜索关键字（应用名称/APPID）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_ownership</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">资产来源，可选值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-mEL7mjKG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hiAL82I5\"><code>CREATE</code> 仅查询组织及下级组织创建的资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QCGUF8IT\"><code>SHARE</code> 仅查询组织及下级组织被共享的资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">筛选应用状态，可选值：<ul data-id=\"u738a58b-HnBdk6i3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3PirPjWA\"><code>OFFLINE</code>已下架</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5hZbyGOc\"><code>PUNISHED</code>违规惩罚</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-y452AhA9\"><code>REVIEWING</code>：审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Xtw8MzP1\"><code>REVIEW_FAIL</code>：审核失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IzakiVIx\"><code>REVIEW_SUCCESS</code>：待发布</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1qzcjxw8ak0w00\"><span style=\"color: #323335;\"></span><code>IN_USE</code><span style=\"color: #323335;\">：已发布</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QyAGRUK9\">按发布时间查询的时间范围</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MveUhTC6\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">发布起始时间，格式：%Y-%m-%d</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IdD6Sszu\">发布结束时间，格式：%Y-%m-%d</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0pqcoB7u\">页码，默认值为<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CN9FxqAO\">页面大小，默认值为<code>10</code>，最大值<code>100</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_generation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 资产版本类型，不传默认全部，如需投放巨量营销智擎版，需要筛选<code>OC_USABLE</code>，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1nwt3651zk740\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-k38ippvgn3k00\"><code>LEGACY</code> 旧版资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1rpkhgtxdqn40\"><code>OC_USABLE</code> 新版资产</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-nyrwvDmt\" id=\"h346b9f0-nyrwvDmt\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Ftools%2Febp%2Fapp%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%2